# class: features
# schema: id | surfaces | source-of-truth-doc-citations | source
# source: docs/features.md
# recipe: novel
# authored: 2026-05-23
# Recipe: per H2 surface group extract id, surfaces (list of rows), source-of-truth-doc citations. Bodies NOT copied. Compression target ~0.25 (list-of-records shape).

data-ingestion | Write endpoint (POST /api/deployments; X-Api-Key on Write group only) | per-tool snippets (curl/GHA/ADO/Jenkins/GitLab CI) | optional pull-mode fetcher (Dashboard.Fetcher; GHA adapter; extensible per ICiCdAdapter) | anonymous-mode transport (zero-PAT demo path when GHA_TOKEN absent or placeholder) | @docs/architecture.md §7 §8, @docs/ci-cd-integration.md, @docs/cr/CR-0009-pull-mode-fetcher-and-progress-reporter.md | @docs/features.md#data-ingestion
views-and-layouts | Four views (Detailed/Compact/Glance/Focus) x three layouts (Matrix/Swim-lane/Workflow-rows) = 12 combinations; view+layout switched from header; per-user localStorage persistence (no server-side preferences) | Matrix deferred to Phase 2.0 per CR-0007; current MVP: Swim-lane + Workflow-rows | @docs/cr/CR-0002-four-named-views-and-attribute-picker.md, @docs/cr/CR-0003-tree-topology-and-layout-axis.md, @docs/cr/CR-0007-defer-matrix-layout-to-phase-2.md, @docs/ui/compact-options.md, @docs/ui/focus-layout-options.md | @docs/features.md#views-and-layouts
box-states | Six canonical states: success / running-with-last / running-failed-with-last / failed-with-last / running / running-failed; dashed divider separates current-state from last-successful when they differ; colour + composition communicates state at a glance | @docs/architecture.md §7 "6 box states", @docs/ui/mockups/deployment-dashboard.html (binary visual contract) | @docs/features.md#box-states
themes | Light/dark/auto (system-preference); localStorage.dashboard.theme; FOIT-free inline-script bootstrap sets data-theme before SPA boot; auto updates live on OS change | @docs/cr/CR-0006-light-dark-auto-theme.md, @docs/adr/ADR-0003-theme-persistence-and-foit-safe-bootstrap.md, @docs/ui/theme-options.md | @docs/features.md#themes
real-time | SSE (GET /api/stream) over Postgres LISTEN/NOTIFY; live updates <=5s after ingest (NFR-03); SSE reconnection via Last-Event-ID; wire shape = per-slot state delta (topology NOT on SSE wire per CR-0003) | @docs/architecture.md §7 SSE + LISTEN/NOTIFY, @docs/cr/CR-0003-tree-topology-and-layout-axis.md | @docs/features.md#real-time-updates
history | Per-slot timeline drawer (status/version/actor/time/run link); retention >=90 days enforced by daily pruning (HISTORY_RETENTION_DAYS default 365 per NFR-07); fetcher opaque cursor for ordered backfill (ADR-0004) | @docs/architecture.md §7 history endpoint, @docs/adr/ADR-0004-opaque-per-progress-reporter-cursor.md | @docs/features.md#history
internal-tooling-posture | No auth on Read group (NFR-04); X-Api-Key middleware on Write group only; single nginx gateway; SPA never embeds API key; RBAC out of scope (NFR-04) | @docs/architecture.md §8, @.agents/ginee/local/bindings.md § Hard constraints | @docs/features.md#internal-tooling-posture
